        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/b2d939/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-18T15:08:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is it still supposed to work that way (interrupting everything)?&nbsp; If so, I just came across a bug:</p>\n<p>Matriarch played Horrid Cacaphony</p>\n<p>&gt;Positive Energy Field triggered</p>\n<p>&gt;Horrid Cacaphony destroyed Planquez-Vous</p>\n<p>&gt;&gt;Action Hero Stuntman used All My Own Stunts</p>\n<p>&gt;&gt;&gt;Action Hero Stuntman played In Medias Res</p>\n<p>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;Positive Energy Field Triggered</p>\n<p>&gt;Horrid Cacaphony continued to resolve...</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>All of this was nested within other resolutions (another Horrid Cacaphony triggering Mask of the Matriarch, as well as several Fowl and Positive Energy Field Triggers).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
